<!--Post: 69--><!--Time: 1085377831-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST69"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:psychesknot@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Psychesknot<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Psychesknot<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, May 23, 2004 - 10:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I am still learning of the finer details of this case.  Does anyone know if there is a Boeing/McDonnell Douglas connection of any kind to this case?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 69-->
<!--Post: 417--><!--Time: 1089471232-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST417"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, July 10, 2004 - 7:53 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->After listening to the audio of BTK, he struck me as a pilot. I am one as well. He is also familiar with the &#39;Crime Classification Manual&#39;. Because of his level of cunning, I feel that he could change his MO just to confound the police. In his writings, he realizes that another part of him is doing these killings. I think that the masturbation at the crime scenes disgusts him, but he is driven by his compulsion. He may have a scar on his face as well.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 417-->
<!--Post: 425--><!--Time: 1089595774-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST425"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Muskogee<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Muskogee<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, July 11, 2004 - 6:29 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Teardrop said: <BR>&#34;I think that the masturbation at the crime scenes disgusts him, but he is driven by his compulsion. He may have a scar on his face as well.&#34; <BR> <BR>Whoa, I&#39;d heard of going blind from masturbating, but this is a new one!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 425-->
<!--Post: 433--><!--Time: 1089638706-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST433"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, July 12, 2004 - 6:25 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dear Muskogee: Compulsive masturbation does reduce zinc levels in the body which  contributes to a number of mental and physical issues.  I had hoped that the &#39;as well&#39; would indicate that the last statement about the scar would be seen as a separate thought.  Should he be a pilot, there is a small possibility of a scar on the face.  If you ever attend a convention of aircraft owners, never will you see in one place so many short men with scars on their faces. Read the Crime Classification Manual and learn about the various physical anomalies that follow certain types of killers. Perhaps a far cry or perhaps not.  The victims would be glad for one more piece of identifying data.  Thanks for the correction. I will try to be more specific. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 433-->
<!--Post: 494--><!--Time: 1089927608-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST494"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Muskogee<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Muskogee<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, July 15, 2004 - 2:40 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Teardrop...I thought it would be obvious, but apparently it wasn&#39;t.  I was joking.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 494-->
<!--Post: 942--><!--Time: 1093724463-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST942"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sapper<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sapper<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->8-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, August 28, 2004 - 1:21 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Her is a possible scinero for the missing years. <BR>I honestly dont think he stopped killing. He just moved his activities else where. So how does theory strike you? <BR>The BTK got a job working for Boeing in the 70&#39;s. <BR>Somewhere in the early 80&#39;s he was transfered to Seattle countinued to kill up there. &#40; he would be just one among many serial killers there&#41;. Then he gets layed off in the post 9-11 years and goes back to Wichita. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
